5.  The Agda standard library 2.3, patched: agda-stdlib-2.3-patched.zip

    The sources of https://github.com/agda/agda-stdlib at v2.3, modified:
    this repository's three patches, stdlib/patches/*.patch, change ten
    modules and add one (Relation.Nullary.Recomputable.Unsafe), so that
    the library checks under Agda 2.9.0.  Two of them are agda-stdlib's
    own commits 1896499f and 1b7f26af (its agda-master branch), applied
    unchanged; the third ports its commit 39631ce9 to v2.3.  Made by this
    repository's flake (packages.stdlib).
    MIT, Copyright (c) 2007-2025 Nils Anders Danielsson, Ulf Norell, and
    the others its LICENCE names; the patches are under the same license.
    The archive carries its LICENCE as agda-stdlib-2.3/LICENCE;
    licenses/agda-stdlib.txt is the same text.


